# docs/book/api.crates — the crates whose rustdoc reference the book publishes under `api/` (leaf `PROGRAM.107`).
#
# One package per line, at `crates/<name>`. `scripts/build_book.sh` builds them with `cargo doc --no-deps`, warnings
# denied, and copies the result into the book's output; `scripts/check_book_anchors.sh` holds each to
# `#![deny(missing_docs)]` and every link a chapter makes into `api/` to one of them. The book is the contract; this
# reference is a view of the code, generated with the book and never committed. Internals — `xtask`, the trust
# instruments, the command line's own modules — are not published.
archogen-api
archogen-outcome
archogen-json
archogen-digest
archogen-install
eadl-front
eadl-model
